{"id": "12-340-2-19", "zh": "依“lato vokāro ca”这条规则，这里借“kāra”一词，使 yo 变为 no；借 ca 字，有时 vo 和 no 都不出现，这就是区别所在。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-340-20-23", "zh": "jantuno、jantuyo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-341-2-8", "zh": "96. satthu（导师），加 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-342-2-16", "zh": "依“satthupitādīnamā sismiṃ silopo ca”，satthu 等词的词末变为 ā，同时 si 脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-342-17-18", "zh": "satthā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-343-2-3", "zh": "“satthu、pitu 等词的”这一项延续管辖下文规则。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-344-2-3", "zh": "在其他词尾之前变为 āra。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-345-2-6", "zh": "在 si 以外的其他词尾之前，satthu 等词的词末变为 āra。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-346-2-5", "zh": "规则：“tato yonamo tu”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-347-2-7", "zh": "在 āra 之后，yo 变为 o。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-347-8-9", "zh": "satthāro。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-348-2-8", "zh": "97. 呼格：he sattha、satthā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-348-9-10", "zh": "satthāro。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-349-2-6", "zh": "98. satthāraṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-349-7-10", "zh": "satthāre、satthāro。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-350-2-15", "zh": "99. 依“nā ā”，在 āra 之后，nā 变为 ā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-350-16-17", "zh": "satthārā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-350-18-21", "zh": "satthārebhi、satthārehi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-351-2-9", "zh": "100. 在 sa 之前，词末变为 u，sa 也脱落。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-352-2-10", "zh": "在 sa 之前，satthu 等词的词末变为 u，sa 也可以脱落。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-352-11-16", "zh": "satthu、satthuno、satthussa。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-353-2-12", "zh": "依“vā namhi”，在 naṃ 之前，可以变为 āra。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-353-13-14", "zh": "satthārānaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-354-2-12", "zh": "依“satthunāttañca”，在 naṃ 之前，satthu 等词的词末可以变为 a。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-354-13-14", "zh": "延长元音后为 satthānaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-355-2-15", "zh": "101. 依“tato smimi”，在 āra 之后，smiṃ 变为 i。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-355-16-26", "zh": "依“āro rassamikāre”，在 i 之前，āra 变为短音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-355-27-28", "zh": "satthari。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-355-29-30", "zh": "satthāresu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-355-31-33", "zh": "nattu（孙子）等词也照此变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-356-2-8", "zh": "102. pitu（父亲）的变化与 satthu 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-356-9-19", "zh": "依“pitādīnamasimhi”，在 si 以外的其他词尾之前，āra 变为短音，这是唯一的区别。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-356-20-21", "zh": "pitaro。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-357-2-6", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，也有 pitūnaṃ 这一形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-357-7-9", "zh": "bhātu（兄弟）等词也照此变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-358-2-6", "zh": "103. abhibhū（征服者）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-358-7-8", "zh": "变为短音时为 abhibhuvo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-358-9-10", "zh": "yo 脱落时为 abhibhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-358-11-16", "zh": "其余变化与 bhikkhu 相同，只是多了短音化这一区别。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-359-2-8", "zh": "104. sabbaññū（一切知者）也照此变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-359-9-13", "zh": "和前面一样，yo 也可以变为 no。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-359-14-17", "zh": "sabbaññuno、sabbaññū。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-360-2-6", "zh": "105. go（牛）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-361-2-3", "zh": "“gāva”这一项延续到下文规则。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-362-2-23", "zh": "依“yosu ca”，go 一词的 o 变为 āva；依“tato yonamo tu”，借其中的 tu 字，yo 变为 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-362-24-25", "zh": "gāvo。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-362-26-27", "zh": "呼格也是如此。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-363-2-7", "zh": "106. 在 aṃ 之前，也变为 āva、ava。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-364-2-11", "zh": "后接 aṃ 时，go 一词的 o 变为 āva 和 ava；借 ca 字，在除 hi 和 naṃ 以外的其余词尾之前也是如此。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-365-2-22", "zh": "107. 依“āvassu vā”，在 aṃ 之前，āva 的词末可以变为 u：gāhvaṃ、gāvaṃ、gavaṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-365-23-24", "zh": "yo：gāvo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-365-25-28", "zh": "gāvena、gavena。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-365-29-32", "zh": "gobhi、gohi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-366-2-15", "zh": "108. 依“gāva se”，在 sa 之前，o 变为 āva。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-366-16-19", "zh": "gāvassa、gavassa。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-366-20-34", "zh": "依“tato na…”这条规则，借 ca 字，名为 naṃ 的词尾变为 aṃ，o 也变为 ava。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-366-35-36", "zh": "gavaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-367-2-17", "zh": "109. 依“suhināsu ca”，借其中的 ca 字，go 也变为 gu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-367-18-21", "zh": "辅音重叠时为 gunnaṃ，另有 gonaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-367-22-33", "zh": "gāvā、gavā、gāvamhā、gavamhā、gāvasmā、gavasmā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-367-34-37", "zh": "gobhi、gohi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-368-2-16", "zh": "110. gāve、gave、gāvamhi、gavamhi、gāvasmiṃ、gavasmiṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-368-17-22", "zh": "gāvesu、gavesu、gosu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "12-369-2-3", "zh": "以上是阳性词。", "confidence": 75}
